<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Tone-Metric Analyzer</title>
<style>
:root{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color-scheme:light dark}body{margin:0;background:Canvas;color:CanvasText}main{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:28px}.panel{border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,CanvasText 20%,transparent);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;margin:16px 0}.row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}button{padding:10px 16px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid currentColor;background:Canvas;color:CanvasText;cursor:pointer}button.active{font-weight:700;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px currentColor}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}input[type=file]{max-width:100%}.muted{opacity:.7}.error{white-space:pre-wrap;border-left:4px solid currentColor;padding:10px 14px}.segment{margin-top:26px}.svgbox{overflow:auto;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,CanvasText 15%,transparent);border-radius:10px;padding:8px}.svgbox svg{display:block;min-width:800px;width:100%;height:auto}.overview svg{min-width:1200px}.measureViewer{margin-top:18px}.measureToolbar,.viewToolbar{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px}.viewToolbar button{padding:7px 11px;font-size:12px}.measureButtons{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;max-height:150px;overflow:auto;padding:3px}.measureButtons button{padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px}.measureCanvas{overflow:auto;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,CanvasText 18%,transparent);border-radius:10px;padding:8px;min-height:300px}.measureCanvas .zoomSurface{transform-origin:top left;width:max-content}.measureCanvas svg{display:block;width:1400px;height:auto;max-width:none}.zoomControl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.zoomControl input{width:180px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:10px}.stat{padding:10px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,CanvasText 12%,transparent);border-radius:8px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px}th,td{padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,CanvasText 10%,transparent);text-align:left}details{margin-top:12px}code{font-family:ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace}.viewLabel{font-weight:700;min-width:120px}.viewExplanation{font-size:13px;opacity:.8;margin:7px 0 12px}.conceptKey{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:8px;margin:10px 0}.conceptKey div{padding:8px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,CanvasText 10%,transparent);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px}
.actualViewer{margin-top:22px}.pageStage{overflow:auto;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,CanvasText 18%,transparent);border-radius:10px;padding:10px;background:#ddd}.pageSurface{position:relative;transform-origin:top left;width:max-content}.pageSurface img{display:block;max-width:none}.pageSurface svg{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:visible}.pageComposite{position:relative;background:#fff}.pageSlice{position:absolute;left:0;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}.pageSlice img{position:absolute;left:0;max-width:none}.noteHalo{mix-blend-mode:multiply}.noteBox{fill:none;stroke-width:1.6}.overlayStatus{padding:8px 10px;margin:8px 0;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,CanvasText 15%,transparent);border-radius:8px;font-size:13px}.legend{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;min-height:20px}.swatch{width:20px;height:10px;border:1px solid #333}.actualNotice{font-size:13px;opacity:.76}.analysisGuide{stroke:#111;stroke-width:.8;opacity:.12;stroke-dasharray:3 3}.layerCellPDF{stroke:#666;stroke-width:.45}.layerAnchorPDF{stroke:#111;stroke-width:.8;opacity:.58}.layerAnchorLevel1PDF{stroke-width:1.3;opacity:.92}.layerAnchorCapPDF{fill:#111;opacity:.82}.layerProjectionPDF{stroke:#111;stroke-width:.65;opacity:.20;stroke-dasharray:2 2}.layerTextPDF{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;fill:#111;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:1.8px;stroke-linejoin:round}.attackLayerGuidePDF{stroke:#111;stroke-width:.55;opacity:.16;stroke-dasharray:2 2}.structuralLayerGuidePDF{stroke:#111;stroke-width:.5;opacity:.11;stroke-dasharray:1.5 3}.structuralLayerTextPDF{font-size:9px;font-weight:500;font-style:italic;fill:#111;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:1.8px;stroke-linejoin:round;opacity:.78}.layerRowLabelPDF{font-size:8px;fill:#111;text-anchor:end;dominant-baseline:middle}.layerTitlePDF{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;fill:#111}.waveFillPDF{fill:#111;opacity:.10}.waveEnvelopePDF{fill:none;stroke:#111;stroke-width:1.15;opacity:.75;stroke-linejoin:miter;stroke-linecap:square}.waveTitlePDF{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;fill:#111}.pivotMarkerPDF{fill:#777;opacity:.72;stroke:#111;stroke-width:.45}.pivotMarkerCompoundPDF{fill:#222;opacity:.88;stroke:#111;stroke-width:.55}.treeBranchPDF{fill:none;stroke:#111;stroke-width:1.05;opacity:.78;stroke-linecap:round}.treeContinuationPDF{fill:none;stroke:#111;stroke-width:.9;opacity:.58;stroke-dasharray:3 2}.treeTitlePDF{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;fill:#111}.treeRowLabelPDF{font-size:8px;fill:#111;text-anchor:end;dominant-baseline:middle}.systemBaseline{stroke:#111;stroke-width:.8;opacity:.12}
</style>
</head>
<body><main>
<h1>Tone-Metric Analyzer <small class="muted">v0.15.2</small></h1>
<p><strong>Paper-aligned recursive Levels + H(t) wave height + D(t) Level density + pivots + trees.</strong> v0.15.2 preserves the paper-aligned event descriptors H(t), D(t), and λ(t), and treats each Definition-8 pivot as a single structural-turning moment at the rightmost crest point before descent.</p>
<p>Attack timing is never inferred from PDF geometry. Parenthetical positions are placed only after score time is fixed. Waves reuse validated attack/structural positions, pivots reuse only validated wave anchors, and trees reuse only actual-attack wave anchors. No tree can create or move musical events, Levels